"name": "Electrolux Professional AB",
"description": "Electrolux Professional AB offers food service, beverage, and laundry products and solutions for professional users. It operates through the Food and Beverage, and Laundry segments. The Food and Beverage segment provides equipment used in food and beverage preparation and consumption, including ovens, refrigerators, dishwashers, and beverage dispensers. The Laundry segment offers equipment used in the professional cleaning cycle such as washing machines, dryers, and ironing products. The company was founded on June 6, 1898 and is headquartered in Stadshagen, Sweden.",
